      "R": {
        "slot": "R",
        "id": "YorickR",
        "name": "海屿悼词",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "约里克召唤迷雾室女，来让约里克的攻击对室女锁定的目标造成额外伤害。室女也会自动从死亡的敌人身上唤起雾行者。",
        "bodyHtml": "约里克召唤拥有<span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">((1050 ~ 3200) + (60% 额外生命值))生命值</span>和<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(50/75/100 + (30% 额外攻击力))魔法攻击伤害</span>的<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">迷雾室女</span>外加2/3/4个<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">雾行者</span>。<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">室女</span>会自动从附近阵亡的敌人身上唤起<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">雾行者</span>并且通过她的攻击标记敌方英雄。当约里克对<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">室女</span>的目标造成伤害时，他将造成<span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">2/2.5/3%最大生命值的魔法伤害</span>。<br /><br />10秒后，约里克可以<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">再次施放</span>这个技能来放走<span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">室女</span>，派她去相距最近的一条战线。<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\"><span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">迷雾室女</span><br /><span class=\"text-orange-600 dark:text-orange-400\">(30 ~ 90)护甲</span><br /><span>(30 ~ 90)魔法抗性</span><br />所受的来自线上小兵的伤害为30%</span>",
